  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 800) #5505 eff 11-15-92; ss by #6087, eff 8-31-95; ss by #7788, eff 10-31-02; ss by #9802, eff 10-31-10; ss by #12762, eff 5-1-19",
